2d3748;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;margin-bottom:14px;\"\u003eOmissions and Watch\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;color:#e2e8f0;line-height:1.7;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOmitted today:\u003c/strong\u003e BLS calendar access returned HTTP 403, so no BLS release was inferred. BEA shows no release for 2026-09-07; Census, Federal Reserve and TreasuryDirect show no regular release or auction on the holiday; NAR was not required for today\u0027s verified calendar.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#e2e8f0;line-height:1.7;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch:\u003c/strong\u003e TreasuryDirect confirms 17-week Bill on 2026-09-09 and 4-week, 8-week, 13-week and 26-week Bills on 2026-09-10, but their exact closing times were not included in the dated source set used here. They are listed as watch items, not selected calendar rows.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"background:#1a1f2e;border:1px solid #2d3748;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.6px;margin-bottom:14px;\"\u003eTrading Strategy Note - ES Futures\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:14px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"background:#141b2d;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;border-left:3px solid #34d399;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#34d399;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:8px;\"\u003eBase Case\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#e2e8f0;line-height:1.6;\"\u003eHoliday-thin liquidity favors responsive, smaller-size trading around the 7722 ES overnight print. Negative NFCI, SOFR at 3.66%, and MOVE below 80 support a calm-liquidity base case, but a 4.78% 10Y and elevated WTI argue against chasing strength.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"background:#141b2d;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;border-left:3px solid #f87171;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#f87171;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:8px;\"\u003eInvalidation\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#e2e8f0;line-height:1.6;\"\u003eLose 7700 and hold below it, or see 10Y above 4.85% and MOVE back above 80, and the constructive bias is invalidated. A sharp oil gap or disorderly reopening after the holiday also invalidates continuation assumptions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e"}